.TH HYPERROUTER 1 "2026-10-26" "hyperRouter 2.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
hyperrouter \- free-model router and terminal coding agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hyperrouter
.RI [ command ]
.RI [ options ]
.PP
.B hyperrouter
.RI [ task ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hyperrouter
routes requests across free model providers, picks the best model for each
task, and runs a full\-screen coding agent with tools: read, write, edit,
search, run commands, web search and fetch, MCP tools, and parallel
subagents. It also exposes an OpenAI\-compatible endpoint on
http://127.0.0.1:8787/v1.
.PP
Run
.B hyperrouter
with no arguments to open the agent TUI, the same way
.B opencode
or
.B freebuff
launch. It does not bypass provider limits: free tiers are pooled, quota is
tracked per account, and exhausted pools fail with a clear error rather than
silently spending money.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B init
Create config, database, protocol and catalog.
.TP
.B catalog
List or refresh the free\-model catalog.
.TP
.B sources
Show which free sources the catalog came from.
.TP
.B providers
List providers and configured account counts.
.TP
.B models
Rank free models for a task.
.TP
.B pick
Pick the single best free model for a task.
.TP
.B prompt
Build an enriched prompt. Alias: \fBenrich\fR.
.TP
.B enrich
Alias for \fBprompt\fR.
.TP
.B route
Run one request through the best free model.
.TP
.B web
Check, search and fetch from the web.
.TP
.B update
Pull a newer hyperRouter and reinstall the script.
.TP
.B completions
Print shell completion for bash, zsh or fish.
.TP
.B man
Print a roff man page for this CLI.
.TP
.B skills
List, inspect and install Agent Skills (SKILL.md files).
.TP
.B mcp
Manage and call MCP servers.
.TP
.B chat
Interactive chat on the free pool.
.TP
.B delegate
Split a task and route each step to its best free model.
.TP
.B agents
List agent backends usable inside hyperRouter.
.TP
.B tui
Full\-screen chat and agent TUI.
.TP
.B agent
Coding agent: read, edit, search and run commands.
.TP
.B serve
Run the OpenAI\-compatible proxy.
.TP
.B service
Start, stop or check the proxy.
.TP
.B accounts
Manage provider account references (never raw keys).
.TP
.B quota
Show per\-account usage and remaining quota.
.TP
.B usage
Show requests, tokens, latency and quota. Alias: \fBstats\fR.
.TP
.B stats
Alias for \fBusage\fR.
.TP
.B keys
Generate and manage the local router API key.
.TP
.B setup
Wire the router into OpenCode, Freebuff and DeepSeek Harness, install the
default skill collections and enable the default MCP servers.
.TP
.B run
Launch an agent with router environment variables.
.TP
.B doctor
Check catalog, accounts, service, sandbox and integrations.
.TP
.B settings
Show or change hyperRouter settings. Alias: \fBconfig\fR.
.TP
.B config
Alias for \fBsettings\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Print help for the program or a subcommand and exit.
.PP
Every subcommand accepts
.B \-\-help
and most accept
.B \-\-json
for machine\-readable output.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/hyperrouter/config.json
Settings, MCP servers, pinned models and approval policy.
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/hyperrouter/router.db
Usage, quota and request history (SQLite).
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/hyperrouter/catalog.json
The cached free\-model catalog.
.TP
.I ~/.config/hyperrouter/skills
Agent Skills installed from collections such as anthropics/skills.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HYPERROUTER_HOME
Data directory override; defaults to
.IR ~/.local/share/hyperrouter .
.TP
.B HYPERROUTER_API_KEY
Local key that clients present to the proxy. Generated by
.BR "hyperrouter keys generate" .
.TP
.B HYPERROUTER_NO_MCP
When set to any non\-empty value, the agent skips MCP tool discovery.
.TP
.B HYPERROUTER_BASE_URL
Base URL handed to OpenCode, Freebuff and DSH launchers, normally
.IR http://127.0.0.1:8787/v1 .
.TP
.B HYPERROUTER_PREFIX
Install prefix used by
.IR install.sh ;
defaults to
.IR ~/.local .
.TP
.B BRAVE_API_KEY ", " TAVILY_API_KEY ", " EXA_API_KEY
Optional search keys. Without them
.B hyperrouter web
uses its keyless search backend.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS
hyperrouter
hyperrouter agent "fix the failing test" \-\-auto
hyperrouter route "summarise this" \-\-model auto\-coding
hyperrouter skills defaults
hyperrouter mcp defaults
hyperrouter doctor \-\-json
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hyperrouter\-doctor (1),
.BR hyperrouter\-settings (1)
.PP
Project home: https://github.com/9ssault/hyperRouter
